              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <a name="x-https://www.cms.gov/Medicare/Medicare-Fee-for-Service-Payment/HospitalAcqCond/Coding-1"> </a>
                  <code>https://www.cms.gov/Medicare/Medicare-Fee-for-Service-Payment/HospitalAcqCond/Coding</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="http://terminology.hl7.org/7.1.0/CodeSystem-presentOnAdmission.html#presentOnAdmission-1">1</a>
                </td>
                <td>Unreported</td>
                <td>Unreported/Not used.  Exempt from POA reporting.  This code is equivalent to a blank on the UB-04, however; it was determined that blanks are undesirable when submitting this data via the 4010A.</td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
